OL,3,AHow fields of Fermanagh helped Daisy
OL,4,AEdgar-Jones prepare for her latest film
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Daisy Edgar-Jones is no
OL,7,Fstranger to Ireland, having spent five
OL,8,Fmonths in the country filming hit drama
OL,9,FNormal People which was released in
OL,10,F2020.
OL,12,FBut it was actually fields in County
OL,13,FFermanagh, where some of her family
OL,14,Flive, that helped her prepare for the
OL,15,Frole of beloved character Elinor
OL,16,FDashwood in Jane Austen's Sense and
OL,17,FSensibility, some 20 years before.
OL,19,FHer mother is from County Down and
OL,20,FEdgar-Jones, now 28, spent her
OL,21,Fchildhood roaming the Northern Irish
OL,22,Fcountryside.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
